  "decisions": [
    {
      "priority": 0,
      "method": "完成现有Rescue CFM−REPLAY matched试验",
      "action_now": "只等待原计划1k/5k完整结果，保留当前recipe",
      "trigger": "同warmstart/phase预算两臂齐全后，看PDMS/NC/DAC/TTC/EP配对CI、new/repaired zero、parent高分退化；同时确认aux真实激活与online_upgrade。",
